1
00:00:39,764 --> 00:00:45,760
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,004 --> 00:00:48,672
=Episode 22=

3
00:01:08,799 --> 00:01:09,599
Your Majesty?

4
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:13,760
Wangshu sharing the truth with us

5
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:15,079
shows rare trust.

6
00:01:15,959 --> 00:01:17,319
It must be because Master Lizhi

7
00:01:17,719 --> 00:01:18,560
is in grave danger.

8
00:01:18,959 --> 00:01:19,640
Don't worry.

9
00:01:20,359 --> 00:01:22,519
I will have Chen Qingxuan
lead men to protect him.

10
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,120
Thank you, Your Majesty.

11
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:29,959
Xingyao,

12
00:01:31,719 --> 00:01:32,640
I came today

13
00:01:33,959 --> 00:01:35,120
because I wanted to see you.

14
00:01:39,599 --> 00:01:41,000
I've been a puppet since childhood.

15
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,760
Sitting on the throne,

16
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,560
every word I spoke

17
00:01:45,840 --> 00:01:47,000
and everything I did

18
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,640
was never by my own choice.

19
00:01:49,319 --> 00:01:50,599
I watched this empire

20
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:52,480
rot away from within,

21
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:55,519
and the people displaced,

22
00:01:56,719 --> 00:01:57,920
yet I couldn't do anything.

23
00:01:59,159 --> 00:01:59,920
I've decided

24
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:01,560
to take action.

25
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:03,760
Even if it meant death,

26
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:06,239
I would no longer be a puppet.

27
00:02:08,599 --> 00:02:09,439
And then...

28
00:02:10,759 --> 00:02:11,560
I met you.

29
00:02:13,319 --> 00:02:14,120
I can't forget

30
00:02:15,159 --> 00:02:16,159
that day at Chunfeng Pavilion,

31
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:18,400
when you limped with hurt legs

32
00:02:18,719 --> 00:02:20,280
yet still outsmarted powerful foes.

33
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,599
Nor can I forget

34
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:26,599
how you splashed tea in my face
for Wangshu.

35
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:33,400
I thought about it for long.

36
00:02:33,639 --> 00:02:36,199
If I could not even protect myself,

37
00:02:37,439 --> 00:02:38,520
how could I protect you?

38
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:40,360
But now,

39
00:02:41,159 --> 00:02:41,840
I am unwilling,

40
00:02:42,479 --> 00:02:44,319
and finally,
I will hide my feelings no more.

41
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,039
Xingyao,

42
00:02:46,919 --> 00:02:48,000
would you be willing

43
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,039
to be my Empress?

44
00:03:02,439 --> 00:03:03,840
Your Majesty,
I don't want to be Empress.

45
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:08,080
Why?

46
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:10,439
Xingyao, I love you.

47
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,960
I pledge the realm to you,

48
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:12,800
my only beloved.

49
00:03:15,319 --> 00:03:17,439
Ever since you shielded me
from that blade,

50
00:03:18,639 --> 00:03:19,840
I have loved you.

51
00:03:20,719 --> 00:03:21,639
Or perhaps,

52
00:03:22,759 --> 00:03:23,439
even earlier.

53
00:03:25,639 --> 00:03:27,719
Seeing you brings me joy.

54
00:03:28,439 --> 00:03:29,400
Being apart from you

55
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:30,960
fills me with longing.

56
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:34,439
The time we spent together

57
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,680
is what I cherish most in my heart.

58
00:03:39,199 --> 00:03:42,120
Then why won't you be my Empress?

59
00:03:43,919 --> 00:03:45,039
Just because it's beautiful

60
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,319
that I am unwilling.

61
00:03:47,199 --> 00:03:49,439
From the moment I learned who you are,

62
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,439
I felt uneasy.

63
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,800
We are worlds apart.

64
00:03:54,439 --> 00:03:55,639
Today, you love me,

65
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,120
so you spare me from kneeling

66
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,639
and treat me as your equal.

67
00:04:00,439 --> 00:04:01,919
But what if you don't some other day?

68
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:03,039
I won't.

69
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:06,240
♪Perhaps lingering reluctance remains♪

70
00:04:06,639 --> 00:04:07,439
There'll be only you

71
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:08,960
in my imperial harem.

72
00:04:09,599 --> 00:04:10,159
Then,

73
00:04:11,159 --> 00:04:12,319
your heart is with the realm.

74
00:04:12,639 --> 00:04:13,719
If one day,

75
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,960
you are forced to take concubines

76
00:04:16,319 --> 00:04:17,560
for the good of the empire

77
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,439
and to balance court factions,

78
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,399
when that time comes,

79
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,920
what will become of me?

80
00:04:25,199 --> 00:04:27,000
Should I show the grace
expected of an Empress

81
00:04:27,319 --> 00:04:28,600
and organize the selection?

82
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:31,600
Or should I act like a bitter woman,

83
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,720
questioning why you broke your promise?

84
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:38,759
I do not want our precious memories

85
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:40,800
to turn into bitter mutual hatred,

86
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:42,800
only to end with,

87
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,439
"I wish we had never met."

88
00:04:52,439 --> 00:04:53,079
Your Majesty,

89
00:04:53,759 --> 00:04:55,839
the title of Empress
is a favor bestowed by you,

90
00:04:56,839 --> 00:04:58,839
a glory that depends entirely
on your grace.

91
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,959
I do not want that kind of grace.

92
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:05,000
I humbly beg you

93
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:07,800
to grant me a chance
to take the imperial exams.

94
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,920
I want to enter the court,

95
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,160
to judge cases

96
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:14,519
and reform the bureaucracy
with my own learning,

97
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,360
to seek justice for common people

98
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:18,160
and for the suffering

99
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,600
my sister once endured,

100
00:05:20,959 --> 00:05:23,959
and to forge an era
where everyone can find their place.

101
00:05:29,519 --> 00:05:30,240
If I can

102
00:05:30,439 --> 00:05:32,240
truly stand on my own in this world,

103
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,439
only then

104
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:36,319
will you no longer be my patron,

105
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,879
nor I your dependent.

106
00:05:41,319 --> 00:05:44,319
How does being the Empress
conflict with being an official?

107
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,040
Once you are Empress,

108
00:05:50,639 --> 00:05:52,319
I can let you participate
in court affairs.

109
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,360
Isn't that better?

110
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,800
If I am your Empress,

111
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:59,399
people will only say
I interfere in court affairs,

112
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,319
exploiting your favor

113
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:02,199
to bewitch you.

114
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:03,800
But if I am an official,

115
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,519
everything I do

116
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,120
and every achievement I earn

117
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,560
will belong to me alone.

118
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:11,680
Your Majesty,

119
00:06:11,959 --> 00:06:15,360
someday, I hope to stand as your equal,

120
00:06:17,399 --> 00:06:18,959
gazing upon the vast world with you.

121
00:06:27,319 --> 00:06:29,360
I came seeking the title
of your husband,

122
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,879
yet you managed
to secure an official post.

123
00:06:33,079 --> 00:06:33,600
Very well.

124
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:35,720
I grant your wish.

125
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,240
Thank you, Your Majesty.

126
00:06:40,759 --> 00:06:41,560
However,

127
00:06:42,519 --> 00:06:43,759
once your achievements

128
00:06:43,959 --> 00:06:45,279
are enough for you to feel proud

129
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:46,240
standing by my side,

130
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:48,279
that Empress throne will still be yours.

131
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:49,959
A capable official and a lovely wife,

132
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,199
I want them both.

133
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:57,920
By the way,

134
00:06:58,360 --> 00:06:59,279
Wangshu

135
00:06:59,279 --> 00:07:00,600
will be wed as a princess.

136
00:07:01,199 --> 00:07:02,879
Let the wedding be held in the palace,

137
00:07:03,959 --> 00:07:06,160
to save me the travel as the in-law.

138
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,040
And one more thing,

139
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,079
could you do me a favor,

140
00:07:14,079 --> 00:07:15,560
and put in a good word with Wangshu

141
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:16,879
and let me taste

142
00:07:16,879 --> 00:07:18,560
the feeling
of soaring through the clouds?

143
00:07:40,759 --> 00:07:41,439
Master Lanyuan,

144
00:07:41,439 --> 00:07:42,519
can you go a little faster?

145
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:43,720
Fly higher!

146
00:07:54,067 --> 00:07:56,192
(Gate of Heavenly Succession)

147
00:08:10,112 --> 00:08:14,752
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

148
00:08:15,462 --> 00:08:19,959
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

149
00:08:23,198 --> 00:08:28,320
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

150
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:31,659
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

151
00:08:31,659 --> 00:08:33,023
♪Refusing to forget♪

152
00:08:36,689 --> 00:08:41,466
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

153
00:08:42,017 --> 00:08:43,807
♪He cannot learn them♪

154
00:08:43,807 --> 00:08:46,942
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

155
00:08:50,094 --> 00:08:52,418
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

156
00:08:52,418 --> 00:08:54,781
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

157
00:08:55,359 --> 00:08:58,023
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

158
00:08:58,023 --> 00:08:59,781
♪Their days ahead are long♪

159
00:09:02,580 --> 00:09:08,416
♪If fate tears us apart♪

160
00:09:09,139 --> 00:09:14,880
♪I will gamble against heaven itself♪

161
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:18,400
♪The loong's wrath
shakes mountains and rivers♪

162
00:09:18,400 --> 00:09:22,016
♪Calamity fire
burns away all evil spirits♪

163
00:09:22,016 --> 00:09:25,312
♪You are a drop of blood upon my heart♪

164
00:09:25,312 --> 00:09:28,480
♪I am a wound etched into your palm♪

165
00:09:29,024 --> 00:09:32,224
♪Cloud steps open,
where does the way home lie♪

166
00:09:32,384 --> 00:09:35,360
♪Scattering my divine soul
to gaze upon you for a lifetime♪

167
00:09:35,936 --> 00:09:38,784
♪Wind and snow bear witness,
this heart was not in vain♪

168
00:09:38,784 --> 00:09:41,312
♪With you here♪

169
00:09:41,312 --> 00:09:44,448
♪Everywhere is my home♪

170
00:09:48,864 --> 00:09:50,944
(Happiness)

171
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:54,200
Bow to each other!

172
00:10:05,559 --> 00:10:06,279
Groom,

173
00:10:06,639 --> 00:10:08,039
drink this nuptial wine,

174
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:10,440
and you'll share life's joys and sorrows
as one

175
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:11,600
from this day forth.

176
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:29,240
The other half is mine.

177
00:10:29,824 --> 00:10:33,024
♪Cool breeze rustles leaves
against red tiles♪

178
00:10:33,568 --> 00:10:36,128
♪Shadows paired
beneath the western window♪

179
00:10:36,128 --> 00:10:39,392
♪I play chess with you by candlelight♪

180
00:10:40,448 --> 00:10:43,840
♪The mortal world is loud and restless♪

181
00:10:45,399 --> 00:10:47,399
Please cut a lock of your hair,

182
00:10:47,799 --> 00:10:49,039
and tie them together

183
00:10:49,679 --> 00:10:50,759
to complete the union.

184
00:10:51,872 --> 00:10:56,960
♪Vanish like mirages in the desert sand♪

185
00:10:57,824 --> 00:11:01,216
♪We listen to the night rain,
sharing wine over quiet talk♪

186
00:11:01,216 --> 00:11:03,840
♪Will swallows return to the branches♪

187
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:06,432
♪At my home tomorrow♪

188
00:11:06,752 --> 00:11:08,384
♪To grow old together as one♪

189
00:11:08,384 --> 00:11:11,872
♪No need to seek a distant paradise♪

190
00:11:11,872 --> 00:11:15,200
♪Grace and youth shine across your brow♪

191
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:18,279
Tied hair unites the couple.

192
00:11:18,639 --> 00:11:20,039
Love remains unbroken and true.

193
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:21,840
This custom is great.

194
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:26,639
Keep it safe.

195
00:11:30,759 --> 00:11:31,919
The ceremony is complete!

196
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:34,840
Groom, you may enter the bridal chamber.

197
00:11:36,759 --> 00:11:37,600
Master Lizhi,

198
00:11:37,799 --> 00:11:39,679
on your wedding night,

199
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:41,399
we can't let you off without hazing.

200
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:42,720
Exactly!

201
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:44,399
Is this also a mortal custom?

202
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:45,240
Yeah.

203
00:11:45,399 --> 00:11:47,440
- It's our mortal way of blessing you.
- Really?

204
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:50,840
The livelier the wedding,
the longer the marriage lasts.

205
00:11:54,039 --> 00:11:54,600
Okay.

206
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:55,879
What do you have in mind?

207
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,600
First, to show your sincerity,

208
00:11:57,960 --> 00:12:00,000
take your brother-in-law for a flight!

209
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:06,519
Answer some questions then.

210
00:12:06,519 --> 00:12:08,840
What does Xingyao like to eat

211
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:09,480
and wear most?

212
00:12:09,759 --> 00:12:11,440
What does she like to eat or wear?

213
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:16,120
Your Majesty!

214
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,799
She loves to eat osmanthus cake

215
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:26,600
and use scented balm.

216
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:29,000
Wait. Haven't you
had people spy on her...

217
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,559
All right, next question.

218
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:33,240
When you were born, were you a human,

219
00:12:33,639 --> 00:12:34,440
a loong,

220
00:12:34,879 --> 00:12:35,840
a snake,

221
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:38,200
or an egg?

222
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:39,136
I was...

223
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,480
I want to know this, too.

224
00:12:42,799 --> 00:12:43,639
Were you a human,

225
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:45,320
a loong,

226
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,039
a snake,

227
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:49,240
or an egg?

228
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:57,399
An egg.

229
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:04,000
Then will you and Princess Hexi

230
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,240
give birth to a human,

231
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,000
a loong,

232
00:13:07,559 --> 00:13:08,879
or lay an egg?

233
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:09,639
We'll have...

234
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:11,120
Protect me! Protect me!

235
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:13,039
Lizhi, calm down!

236
00:13:13,399 --> 00:13:14,440
It's our wedding day.

237
00:13:15,159 --> 00:13:15,679
Be good.

238
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:18,679
Let's go.

239
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:20,120
Too many customs.

240
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:21,440
I can't wait.

241
00:13:24,467 --> 00:13:27,872
♪The loong's wrath
shakes mountains and rivers♪

242
00:13:27,872 --> 00:13:31,040
♪Calamity fire
burns away all evil spirits♪

243
00:13:31,232 --> 00:13:34,368
♪You are a drop of blood upon my heart♪

244
00:13:34,528 --> 00:13:38,176
♪I am a wound etched into your palm♪

245
00:13:38,528 --> 00:13:41,536
♪Cloud steps open,
where does the way home lie♪

246
00:13:41,536 --> 00:13:44,928
♪Scattering my divine soul
to gaze upon you for a lifetime♪

247
00:13:44,928 --> 00:13:48,000
♪Wind and snow bear witness,
this heart was not in vain♪

248
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:50,432
♪With you here♪

249
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:52,279
With that stunt you pulled,

250
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:53,919
His Majesty will have a headache again.

251
00:13:56,559 --> 00:13:58,360
He pestered me with drinks
during the day

252
00:13:58,919 --> 00:13:59,960
to keep me away from you,

253
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,480
and came teasing us at night

254
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,279
to delay our wedding night.

255
00:14:03,919 --> 00:14:05,480
So at the very beginning,

256
00:14:06,639 --> 00:14:09,000
were you really just an egg?

257
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:12,759
A black egg?

258
00:14:19,399 --> 00:14:20,279
A night like this

259
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:21,600
is wonderful.

260
00:14:24,879 --> 00:14:25,799
Seven days later,

261
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:28,519
you'll go to Loong Abyss
to disperse your qi,

262
00:14:28,759 --> 00:14:30,519
awaiting the Cloud Steps' opening
and core restoration.

263
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:33,600
If anything...

264
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:34,519
Cherish the present.

265
00:14:35,919 --> 00:14:36,679
Don't dwell on tomorrow.

266
00:14:44,879 --> 00:14:45,799
It's snowing.

267
00:14:59,759 --> 00:15:00,960
Only His Majesty and I know

268
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:02,440
Master Lizhi's leaving.

269
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:04,279
Publicly, we say that we sent troops

270
00:15:04,879 --> 00:15:05,919
to thank the Loong Lord

271
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,240
for the princess's return.

272
00:15:08,879 --> 00:15:09,720
Thank you, Your Majesty.

273
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:17,440
Wait for me.

274
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:19,200
In one month,

275
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:21,240
we will meet again.

276
00:15:23,476 --> 00:15:25,056
(Wangshu)

277
00:15:28,692 --> 00:15:29,664
(Wangshu)

278
00:15:29,664 --> 00:15:32,000
(Wangshu, Lizhi)

279
00:15:34,559 --> 00:15:35,639
Come back safe and sound.

280
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:54,480
Are you ready?

281
00:16:02,388 --> 00:16:06,963
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

282
00:16:07,738 --> 00:16:12,235
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

283
00:16:15,474 --> 00:16:20,596
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

284
00:16:20,596 --> 00:16:23,935
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

285
00:16:23,935 --> 00:16:25,299
♪Refusing to forget♪

286
00:16:28,965 --> 00:16:33,742
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

287
00:16:34,293 --> 00:16:36,083
♪He cannot learn them♪

288
00:16:36,083 --> 00:16:39,218
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

289
00:16:42,370 --> 00:16:44,694
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

290
00:16:44,694 --> 00:16:47,057
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

291
00:16:47,635 --> 00:16:50,299
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

292
00:16:50,299 --> 00:16:52,057
♪Their days ahead are long♪
